    <Event name="onClick" paragraph="BTN-COUNT--ONCLICK"><![CDATA[       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.

       DATA DIVISION.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

           *> The counter is the label's own caption: a property is a data item.

           ADD     1                             TO    LBL-CLICKS::Caption
]]></Event>
